# MiniMax-M2: minimax_test_model/ is deliberately NOT ignored (~132 KB). Unlike
# test_model/ it is not reliably regenerable — the oracle is only correct on
# transformers < 5.0 (see the version guard in make_minimax_test_model.py), so
# the committed copy IS the reference.
#
# Its Picchio-named twin IS ignored: fuse_minimax_test_model.py rebuilds it
# byte-identically from the above, using only numpy + safetensors, so it carries
# none of that version hazard. Regenerate with:
#   python fuse_minimax_test_model.py minimax_test_model minimax_test_model_picchio
minimax_test_model_picchio/
minimax_test_model_deep/
minimax_test_model_deep_picchio/
